# labwc: the daemon relies on labwc sending the modifier state to clients
# without keyboard focus. python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-gtklayershell-0.1:
# the sheet, GTK 3 so it follows the Arc theme. python3-gi-cairo: clicks go
# through the sheet.
Depends: python3,
         python3-gi,
         python3-gi-cairo,
         gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
         gir1.2-gtklayershell-0.1,
         labwc,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: keyboard shortcut sheet for the FlickOS labwc session
 Press and hold the Super (Windows) key in the FlickOS session and a sheet
 with the keyboard shortcuts appears until the key is let go. The shortcuts
 keep working while it is shown. It is also in the Settings menu.
 .
 The sheet lists the shortcuts labwc actually uses, read from its rc.xml:
 the FlickOS defaults, the tiling keys while tiling is on, or the user's
 own configuration.
